      "chunk_id": "slide_Digital Twin - Project Overview_3_chunk_0_session_b801bec1",
      "text": "Objective Build capabilities on NVIDIA Omniverse platform Detecting faults and changing the visual of related parts of Electric circuit with 4 sub-circuit connected to each other Main Features Definitions of each part of electrical circuit is stored in predefined master data using python The detailed information of errors induced in the electric circuit are stored in log files Alert signals for the parts having defects or showing anomaly Custom format for defect visualization Text Alert Color change of the component 4 Digital Twin: Phase 1 (June 2023 to September 2023) Electric circuit (Raw 3D Model) Electric circuit (Digital Twin Model)",
