      "chunk_id": "slide_Digital Twin - Project Overview_4_chunk_0_session_b801bec1",
      "text": "Digital Twin: Phase 2 (October 2023 to December 2023) Objective: Implementation of the navigation of 3D primitives such Position Marker and Human character, which acquires coordinates in real time (JSON file input) and navigates these primitives in the direction of those coordinates 5 Main Features of the Experiment: Support for input of X, Y, and Z coordinates Individual navigation of primitives Navigation of multiple primitives at the same time Speed can be set dynamically (input from user) for Position Marker",
